WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 8]

01:39.430 --> 01:40.490
You want to see my sword?

01:41.150 --> 01:42.160
I want to see

01:42.390 --> 01:43.930
who's the strongest swordsman

01:44.310 --> 01:45.410
of this Su generation.

01:45.840 --> 01:47.160
Why is the Su family's top swordsman

01:47.160 --> 01:47.930
one of them?

01:48.480 --> 01:49.650
Did Su Ze crown himself?

01:50.200 --> 01:51.180
You use daggers.

01:51.760 --> 01:52.740
If you take a sword,

01:53.310 --> 01:54.210
I'll looked forward

01:54.390 --> 01:55.290
to that instant

01:55.670 --> 01:56.290
you draw,

01:57.030 --> 01:58.570
to your blade's light.

01:59.860 --> 02:00.770
Let's make a bet.

02:01.510 --> 02:03.340
How many moves before Su Ze's down?

02:04.150 --> 02:05.650
Ze is still too young.

02:07.120 --> 02:08.770
Within five moves, I'd say.

02:16.160 --> 02:16.900
I'll make another bet.

02:17.390 --> 02:18.970
I predict that Su Muyu can defeat him

02:19.550 --> 02:20.340
with just one move.

02:22.950 --> 02:24.650
I heard that you practice the Sword Art of Soul Destruction.

02:25.040 --> 02:26.140
Is killing your foes not enough?

02:27.120 --> 02:29.020
Do you have to destroy their souls as well?

02:29.390 --> 02:31.180
Although there's a sinister aura surrounding your sword,

02:31.790 --> 02:33.020
there's no domineering aura surrounding it.

02:33.510 --> 02:34.810
It's because you don't understand the way of the sword.

02:36.610 --> 02:37.280
Break!

02:53.160 --> 02:53.970
A domineering aura doesn't come from ferocity

02:54.830 --> 02:55.620
or ruthlessness.

02:56.110 --> 02:57.370
It comes with contempt.

03:13.790 --> 03:14.620
The Dormant Dragon Sword?

03:25.260 --> 03:25.950
[Sword Qi Soars]

03:25.950 --> 03:26.580
Master Su.

03:30.670 --> 03:32.210
Long time no see,

03:33.160 --> 03:34.090
Lord Kui.

03:35.080 --> 03:36.580
The poison in the Patriarch's body has been neutralized.

03:39.320 --> 03:40.740
He instructed me to bring the Dormant Dragon Sword here

03:41.670 --> 03:42.900
and deliver it to you, the head of the Su family.

03:54.360 --> 03:55.140
What conditions does he have?

03:55.990 --> 03:56.620
From now on, I,

03:57.510 --> 03:58.180
Uncle Zhe,

03:59.230 --> 03:59.930
Changhe,

04:00.670 --> 04:01.900
the Patriarch, and the rest of us

04:03.320 --> 04:04.930
will leave Blood River.

04:06.990 --> 04:08.300
What has that got to do with me?

04:10.080 --> 04:10.860
You traitor.

04:11.390 --> 04:12.250
That's not it.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.170
I'm serious.

04:15.830 --> 04:16.420
Su Muyu.

04:16.910 --> 04:17.890
Don't try to slander me.

04:18.560 --> 04:19.370
Enough.

04:21.200 --> 04:22.320
Just now, you said

04:22.710 --> 04:24.060
"the rest of us",

04:24.710 --> 04:26.490
who exactly is included?

04:27.120 --> 04:28.250
I will come up with a name list.

04:28.880 --> 04:30.250
Everyone in the name list

04:30.910 --> 04:32.250
will leave Blood River.

04:38.590 --> 04:41.250
Are you trying to disband Blood River?

04:41.920 --> 04:43.490
Those who wish to remain may remain.

04:44.050 --> 04:45.320
Those who wish to leave may leave.

04:46.200 --> 04:47.600
I just hope to give

04:47.600 --> 04:49.180
every member of Blood River

04:49.880 --> 04:51.420
a chance to decide their fate.

04:58.390 --> 04:59.810
Muyu, oh, Muyu.

05:00.940 --> 05:03.520
You've served the Patriarch for many years.

05:03.680 --> 05:06.620
You should know how ridiculous

05:07.320 --> 05:08.930
this idea of yours is.

05:09.760 --> 05:11.250
Even if I agree to it,

05:11.830 --> 05:13.010
the Soul Reapers' Hall

05:13.710 --> 05:14.810
will still

05:14.830 --> 05:16.890
put a bounty on your heads.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.490
They will chase you all until the end of the world!

05:19.470 --> 05:20.690
That's our business.

05:21.950 --> 05:23.660
Right now, you just need to decide

05:24.510 --> 05:25.810
whether you wish to wield the sword or not.

05:36.120 --> 05:36.780
Master Su.

05:37.350 --> 05:38.010
This isn't the best timing

05:38.200 --> 05:39.420
to wield the Dormant Dragon Sword.

05:39.950 --> 05:40.570
You mustn't agree to

05:40.880 --> 05:42.060
Su Muyu's condition.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.250
The Patriarch

05:52.720 --> 05:55.290
is trying to test me here.

05:59.730 --> 06:03.270
Wielding this sword alone isn't enough.

06:05.760 --> 06:07.180
I have to wield it

06:07.510 --> 06:09.690
and leave Jiuxiao City in one piece.

06:12.760 --> 06:13.540
When do you think

06:13.910 --> 06:15.060
is the best time

06:15.590 --> 06:16.570
and place

06:17.030 --> 06:18.010
for me to wield it, then?

06:19.210 --> 06:22.780
Opportunities are always fleeting.

06:22.880 --> 06:23.670
Therefore,

06:23.800 --> 06:25.120
the best timing

06:25.440 --> 06:27.470
is the one you seize!

06:32.880 --> 06:33.860
I shall take

06:38.950 --> 06:40.130
the Dormant Dragon Sword.

06:40.350 --> 06:41.180
Wait!

06:51.470 --> 06:52.490
Don't you think

06:52.680 --> 06:53.540
that it's too early for your family

06:54.270 --> 06:55.570
to wield the Dormant Dragon Sword?

07:07.830 --> 07:08.570
Who's that?

07:09.200 --> 07:10.740
Mu Ciling, The Death Coffin.

07:10.810 --> 07:12.060
That's Mu Ciling of the Mu family.

07:12.880 --> 07:13.880
He shared the same master as Mu Zizhe,

07:13.880 --> 07:15.580
who was the former family head of the Mu family.

07:16.440 --> 07:17.810
Back then, he stole the Hell Palm's manual

07:17.880 --> 07:19.100
from the Patriarch.

07:19.120 --> 07:20.130
He cultivated it in secret.

07:20.640 --> 07:21.890
In the end, he became

07:21.950 --> 07:23.660
a half-man, half-monster freak.

07:24.640 --> 07:25.250
After that,

07:25.510 --> 07:26.690
his deeds were exposed

07:26.830 --> 07:27.660
due to Mu Zizhe.

07:28.320 --> 07:29.130
In the end, he was confined

07:29.200 --> 07:30.250
within the coffin.

07:52.030 --> 07:53.200
Darn it.

07:53.200 --> 07:55.580
[Mu Ciling, Mu family]

07:56.270 --> 07:58.420
Where's that darned Mu Zizhe?

08:00.320 --> 08:01.980
Show yourself!

08:07.830 --> 08:08.330
Who's there?

08:09.080 --> 08:11.060
How dare you run wild on the Su family's grounds?

08:13.150 --> 08:14.690
That buzz cut is something else.

08:16.200 --> 08:17.660
You looked like a hairy egg.

08:18.760 --> 08:19.370
You!

08:31.390 --> 08:32.660
Mu Zizhe must've lost his mind.

08:32.950 --> 08:34.450
He actually released a fellow like that from his confinement.

08:34.780 --> 08:36.240
Rumor has it that he didn't master

08:36.240 --> 08:37.210
the Hell Palm.

08:37.710 --> 08:39.180
It seems Mu Zizhe lied to us.

08:39.520 --> 08:40.730
A red aura is emanating from his palm.

08:41.230 --> 08:42.180
That means the level of his Hell Palm

08:42.320 --> 08:43.380
has advanced to at least the eighth tier.

08:43.990 --> 08:45.260
It seems he's more powerful

08:45.950 --> 08:47.660
than the heads of the Three Families.

08:58.320 --> 08:58.970
Don't be silly.

08:58.990 --> 08:59.930
You aren't his target.

08:59.950 --> 09:00.660
Why are you trying to stick your head out?

09:03.160 --> 09:03.930
How did you injure your hand?

09:05.680 --> 09:06.180
I'm fine.

09:06.660 --> 09:08.010
I just fought

09:08.010 --> 09:08.840
that darned Mu Zizhe.

09:08.950 --> 09:09.810
We were on equal terms.

09:12.010 --> 09:12.730
Hairy Egg.

09:13.440 --> 09:14.570
Do you have a death wish?

09:15.800 --> 09:16.540
Master Mu said

09:17.160 --> 09:18.850
if you could defeat the head of the Su family

09:19.200 --> 09:20.140
and stole the Dormant Dragon Sword,

09:20.680 --> 09:21.730
he would grant you freedom.

09:22.950 --> 09:24.930
Who does Mu Zizhe think he is?

09:25.920 --> 09:27.690
How dare he order me around?

09:31.560 --> 09:32.210
Mu Ciling.

09:32.680 --> 09:33.060
You...

09:33.350 --> 09:34.380
Aren't you afraid of the Heart-Piercing Poison?

09:34.630 --> 09:36.060
You're doing this again, huh?

09:36.590 --> 09:37.970
You would give me the antidote if I defeat him, huh?

09:38.280 --> 09:39.090
Are you guys sure about that?

09:39.310 --> 09:40.440
Master Mu made the promise himself.

09:41.800 --> 09:42.540
Fine, then.

09:44.110 --> 09:45.070
Although Mu Zizhe

09:45.070 --> 09:46.330
isn't someone decent,

09:46.780 --> 09:48.380
I guess I'll trust him this time.

09:49.990 --> 09:50.850
Who do I have to defeat again?

09:51.440 --> 09:52.210
The head of the Su family,

09:52.830 --> 09:53.780
Su Jinhui.

09:58.440 --> 09:59.380
Lower your volume.

10:16.870 --> 10:17.720
What's the name

10:17.720 --> 10:18.730
of that brat again?

10:19.040 --> 10:19.690
Mu Tianlin.

10:21.910 --> 10:23.600
It sounds like the name

10:23.600 --> 10:24.970
of someone who's about to die.

10:26.560 --> 10:27.300
What's your name, then?

10:28.560 --> 10:29.140
Su Ze.

10:29.470 --> 10:30.780
"Ze", as in the grace of nature?

10:31.200 --> 10:31.850
That's right.

10:42.560 --> 10:44.810
That also sounds like the name of someone who's about to die.

10:46.280 --> 10:47.450
However, Su Jinhui

10:47.560 --> 10:48.540
is different.

10:53.200 --> 10:54.140
That sounds like the name

10:57.560 --> 10:59.260
of a person who's difficult to kill.

11:01.280 --> 11:02.540
In life, one faces Ciling.

11:03.110 --> 11:04.540
In death, one faces the Hell King.

11:05.680 --> 11:06.690
Ten years ago,

11:07.110 --> 11:09.610
I tried to persuade Mu Zizhe to kill you.

11:10.470 --> 11:11.500
He refused to do so.

11:12.950 --> 11:15.210
He said you might be of use to him

11:15.870 --> 11:17.020
in the future.

11:18.320 --> 11:19.140
I didn't expect

11:19.750 --> 11:21.020
the so-called "future" he mentioned

11:21.270 --> 11:23.020
was today.

11:24.990 --> 11:26.480
But you actually think

11:27.110 --> 11:29.210
you can kill me by yourself.

11:30.160 --> 11:31.610
Doesn't that sound hilarious to you?

11:32.200 --> 11:33.610
Let me just give it a try,

11:34.280 --> 11:35.540
and we'll find out.

11:36.040 --> 11:37.540
You're just a traitor of the Mu family.

11:38.440 --> 11:40.330
You're not worth my effort, the head of the Su family.

11:48.950 --> 11:49.970
You're quite good at swordsmanship.

11:50.710 --> 11:52.260
You're much more powerful than that hairy egg.

11:52.710 --> 11:53.330
However,

11:54.280 --> 11:55.970
at best, you're merely decent.

12:04.230 --> 12:05.060
Uncle Qiu.

12:22.160 --> 12:23.520
Su Jinhui.

12:23.950 --> 12:25.020
You're finally willing to show yourself

12:25.040 --> 12:25.970
and engage us in a battle.

12:26.680 --> 12:28.380
Back then, it took the three of you

12:28.870 --> 12:30.450
to barely win against me.

12:30.920 --> 12:32.690
Now, you're the only person left.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.090
Are you afraid?

12:36.400 --> 12:37.730
I've practiced swordsmanship for 40 years.

12:38.200 --> 12:39.540
I've slain all kinds of monsters and saints.

12:40.470 --> 12:42.540
The word "fear" means nothing to me.

12:47.870 --> 12:48.450
Not bad at all.

12:48.870 --> 12:50.020
It's been many years

12:50.040 --> 12:51.380
since I last witnessed Master Su's techniques.

12:54.680 --> 12:56.020
Having fun watching this?

12:57.710 --> 12:58.780
It looks quite interesting.

13:00.870 --> 13:01.420
Changhe.

13:02.440 --> 13:03.090
What ending do you hope

13:03.180 --> 13:04.090
this play will have?

13:09.630 --> 13:10.450
For you to be the Patriarch

13:10.470 --> 13:11.730
and for me to be the head of the Su family.

13:13.320 --> 13:14.260
Didn't we make this promise

13:14.280 --> 13:14.970
a long time ago?

13:15.440 --> 13:16.060
All right.

13:16.830 --> 13:17.900
Let's join hands

13:18.520 --> 13:19.260
and deal with him together.

13:24.590 --> 13:25.610
Su Muyu,

13:26.040 --> 13:26.690
you're something else.

13:26.920 --> 13:28.330
You've even learned how to trick people now.

13:29.280 --> 13:30.780
You think I have no idea what's on your mind, huh?

13:31.320 --> 13:32.450
You want to use me to repel your foes.

13:32.470 --> 13:33.300
After that, you'll deliver the sword

13:34.630 --> 13:36.040
to the head of the Su family.

13:36.350 --> 13:37.450
I'm thoroughly impressed.

13:39.080 --> 13:40.210
Hell Palm!

14:02.870 --> 14:04.260
So, there are still other martial arts experts around.

14:05.470 --> 14:06.090
Go!

14:22.770 --> 14:23.930
This old fool

14:23.930 --> 14:24.960
is quite the experienced swordsman.

14:25.750 --> 14:27.090
No wonder Mu Zizhe

14:27.990 --> 14:29.450
assigned the task to me.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.260
Right now, I can integrate my Hell Palm

14:32.160 --> 14:33.810
into my swordsmanship.

14:34.160 --> 14:35.780
You may have seen the palm techniques of the Hell King,

14:36.270 --> 14:38.480
but have you ever seen his blade before?

14:55.080 --> 14:56.900
Frostblade Aura?

14:59.230 --> 15:00.330
Interesting.

15:06.680 --> 15:08.020
This was a story from a long time ago.

15:08.800 --> 15:10.570
In "Journey to the West",

15:11.160 --> 15:12.140
Sun Wukong drew a circle

15:12.200 --> 15:13.140
with his staff.

15:13.830 --> 15:15.730
No matter how the spirits and demons rage outside the circle,

15:15.990 --> 15:18.450
within the circle,

15:18.470 --> 15:19.540
all stays serene.

15:20.520 --> 15:21.500
But you see, the different thing is,

15:22.630 --> 15:24.610
Sun Wukong's circle entraps people

15:25.010 --> 15:26.140
while my circle

15:26.400 --> 15:28.180
allows people to enter and exit at will.

15:28.950 --> 15:30.180
Wherever I stand,

15:30.990 --> 15:33.060
there lies heaven and earth.

15:47.200 --> 15:48.780
This will be interesting.

15:50.280 --> 15:51.180
Muyu, do you wish to join their battle?

15:52.040 --> 15:53.270
If I lend Master Su a hand,

15:53.270 --> 15:54.060
and if he can only win against

15:54.560 --> 15:55.730
Mu Ciling with my help,

15:56.160 --> 15:57.570
even if he's able to pull out the Dormant Dragon Sword,

15:58.440 --> 16:00.060
he won't be able to subdue the Three Families.

16:00.870 --> 16:01.500
On the contrary,

16:01.950 --> 16:03.140
if Master Su wins the battle,

16:03.710 --> 16:04.690
at least the Mu family

16:05.470 --> 16:06.810
won't dare to cause trouble again.

16:07.950 --> 16:08.500
All right.

16:09.280 --> 16:10.500
Let's place our bets, then.

16:11.200 --> 16:11.970
Take a guess

16:12.150 --> 16:12.970
at who will win.

16:13.560 --> 16:15.060
Master Su intends to use his full strength.

16:16.680 --> 16:18.660
Even if Mu Ciling has mastered the Hell Palm,

16:19.230 --> 16:20.380
his foundation won't be deep.

16:20.710 --> 16:21.690
He'll surely lose

16:21.920 --> 16:22.690
once enough time has passed.

16:22.820 --> 16:23.900
You're wrong.

16:24.800 --> 16:26.090
You wouldn't be this naive

16:26.090 --> 16:27.380
had you taken a peek at the manual.

16:27.870 --> 16:29.260
That's a crazy martial art.

16:29.800 --> 16:31.380
The depth of one's foundation doesn't matter at all.

16:33.630 --> 16:34.420
Have you sneaked a peek at it before?

16:35.090 --> 16:35.840
No.

16:36.910 --> 16:37.900
It's just a guess.

16:59.080 --> 16:59.540
Master Su,

17:00.470 --> 17:01.690
the Mu family has released Mu Ciling.

17:04.320 --> 17:05.570
It seems the death of Mu Bai

17:06.040 --> 17:08.700
has enraged Mu Zizhe.

17:09.430 --> 17:10.090
And,

17:11.630 --> 17:12.370
he has arrived.

17:24.040 --> 17:25.300
Hell Palm,

17:26.430 --> 17:27.780
each tier represents a higher floor.

17:28.590 --> 17:30.260
At the eighth tier, one beholds Heaven and Earth.

17:31.800 --> 17:33.220
But when you reach the ninth tier,

17:34.630 --> 17:36.220
you shall turn into Heaven and Earth itself.

17:40.480 --> 17:41.980
I will ascend into the ninth tier soon.

18:07.600 --> 18:08.610
I won the bet.

18:12.190 --> 18:12.910
Su Muyu.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.650
Stay here. Don't go out.

18:14.910 --> 18:15.500
Mu Ciling!

18:15.830 --> 18:16.820
Steal the Dormant Dragon Sword first!

18:16.900 --> 18:17.890
We can plan it through after that!

18:22.390 --> 18:23.020
Uncle Qidao?

18:23.960 --> 18:24.980
Is that a member of the Xie family?

18:25.830 --> 18:26.410
Back then,

18:26.800 --> 18:28.260
the Su family, which was the strongest family out of the three,

18:28.830 --> 18:30.260
has been utterly defeated

18:30.430 --> 18:31.700
by Mu Ciling alone.

18:39.040 --> 18:40.460
Since I've obtained the Dormant Dragon Sword,

18:41.040 --> 18:42.060
can I become

18:43.150 --> 18:44.330
the next Patriarch?

18:45.110 --> 18:46.300
It's far too early for that.

18:47.350 --> 18:48.650
It's yours only if you can

18:49.280 --> 18:50.300
take it with you.

18:56.240 --> 18:56.850
I'm hungry.

18:56.870 --> 18:58.890
I'm in no mood to fight. I'll make a move first.

18:59.150 --> 19:00.130
He and his petty tricks.

19:03.480 --> 19:04.260
You thief!

19:04.590 --> 19:05.260
Where do you think you're going?

19:05.670 --> 19:06.810
What exactly are you up to?

19:07.280 --> 19:08.410
Although I, Su Changhe,

19:08.910 --> 19:10.050
am injured,

19:10.590 --> 19:12.330
I have to retrieve the Dormant Dragon Sword for my family's sake.

19:13.720 --> 19:15.650
None of us is a match for him.

19:16.430 --> 19:18.020
You're seriously wounded.

19:18.800 --> 19:19.780
Even if you catch up to him,

19:20.760 --> 19:21.890
it'll be pointless.

19:22.020 --> 19:23.720
[Unpredictable, Untraceable]

19:23.720 --> 19:24.890
A sharp blade breaks easily.

19:25.560 --> 19:26.650
Master Su's resolve

19:27.240 --> 19:28.610
is just like the serpent blade.

19:29.000 --> 19:30.060
He fell just as

19:30.080 --> 19:31.570
he was about to

19:32.800 --> 19:33.500
reach the position of Patriarch.

19:34.830 --> 19:35.570
Master Su...

19:37.000 --> 19:37.740
Su Muyu.

19:38.720 --> 19:39.410
I don't think

19:39.430 --> 19:40.460
you have a choice now.

19:51.720 --> 19:52.570
Muyu,

19:53.560 --> 19:55.020
relay my message to the Patriarch.

19:56.560 --> 19:57.540
I was unable

19:59.830 --> 20:01.130
to wield the Dormant Dragon Sword.

20:03.280 --> 20:04.540
I've let him down.

20:09.910 --> 20:11.060
All members of the Su family,

20:11.830 --> 20:12.570
sheathe your swords!

20:13.110 --> 20:13.810
Yes, sir!

20:18.080 --> 20:19.020
So, the so-called strongest family

20:19.190 --> 20:20.220
of the Three Families

20:21.320 --> 20:22.460
is giving up already, huh?

20:24.040 --> 20:25.650
The Mu family gave rise to a harbinger of death.

20:26.350 --> 20:27.260
As for the Su family,

20:27.390 --> 20:28.460
it gave rise to the Umbrella Ghost

20:28.560 --> 20:29.740
and the Undertaker.

20:30.520 --> 20:31.370
It's a shame that the Umbrella Ghost

20:31.390 --> 20:32.700
already has a new identity.

20:33.520 --> 20:34.980
And the Undertaker still wonders

20:35.960 --> 20:37.540
whom he's to bury.

20:38.080 --> 20:38.700
Me?

20:39.350 --> 20:41.090
Of course I am to bury myself.

20:48.520 --> 20:49.890
You haven't accomplished your mission yet.

20:50.910 --> 20:51.850
What do you plan to do?

20:56.040 --> 20:57.650
Master Su has already given up on the title of Patriarch.

20:58.720 --> 20:59.460
As for what will happen after this,

21:00.520 --> 21:01.740
we need to discuss it with the Patriarch.

21:02.960 --> 21:03.610
Our current priority

21:04.280 --> 21:05.780
is to retrieve the Dormant Dragon Sword.

21:06.520 --> 21:07.540
You think you can retrieve it alone?

21:11.670 --> 21:12.500
Are you willing to help me out?

21:15.910 --> 21:16.370
Me?

21:17.760 --> 21:19.020
I'm seriously wounded.

21:21.040 --> 21:21.610
I guess that's fine too.

21:22.760 --> 21:23.410
At least

21:24.380 --> 21:25.070
we won't need to

21:25.070 --> 21:26.300
engage each other for the time being.

21:32.840 --> 21:34.380
What a naive fellow.

22:06.260 --> 22:09.300
[Water Official, Soul Reapers' Hall]

22:15.590 --> 22:16.650
The Dormant Dragon Sword is mine now.

22:17.190 --> 22:18.260
It's just a sword.

22:18.670 --> 22:20.090
Is it truly worth all the hassle?

22:21.000 --> 22:21.940
The Dormant Dragon Sword

22:21.960 --> 22:22.610
is no ordinary sword.

22:23.390 --> 22:24.570
Now, it seems the chaotic situation

22:24.590 --> 22:25.500
between the Three Families will grow worse.

22:26.150 --> 22:26.980
We should keep

22:27.250 --> 22:28.740
the Dormant Dragon Sword in the Soul Reapers' Hall.

22:36.890 --> 22:38.130
Who's playing tricks on me again?

22:38.210 --> 22:39.720
There's something off about the sword.

22:40.190 --> 22:42.020
I suppose I've underestimated Mu Mingce.

22:47.870 --> 22:48.700
Leave the sword behind!

22:53.830 --> 22:56.370
That's Su Jinhui's Frostblade Aura.

23:05.630 --> 23:06.260
Wait.

23:07.430 --> 23:08.370
That isn't a sword aura.

23:10.190 --> 23:13.060
That's the Wen family's Death in Thirty Feet.

23:15.430 --> 23:17.810
That's one of the hardest poison arrays to neutralize in the world.

23:18.870 --> 23:19.500
If an ordinary person

23:19.960 --> 23:21.570
inhales the air even for a second,

23:22.280 --> 23:23.570
they will die in an hour.

23:24.430 --> 23:25.220
This young girl

23:26.040 --> 23:27.220
is quite capable.

23:27.800 --> 23:29.740
She knows the martial arts of the Su family,

23:30.040 --> 23:31.540
and she can use the Wen family's poison.

23:32.190 --> 23:33.370
You're the only one in the world who's capable of that.

23:35.560 --> 23:36.940
Let's wait here, then.

23:37.870 --> 23:39.650
She'll leave the array eventually.

23:45.960 --> 23:46.650
Miss,

23:47.480 --> 23:48.940
you can't maintain your Death in Thirty Feet

23:49.150 --> 23:50.410
forever.

23:51.720 --> 23:52.810
Give me the sword,

23:53.190 --> 23:54.330
and I'll spare you.

23:55.760 --> 23:56.700
You think it won't last

23:56.760 --> 23:58.010
just because you said so?

23:58.590 --> 23:59.410
Even after the current cast is over,

23:59.830 --> 24:00.780
I can cast it again.

24:01.150 --> 24:02.170
I'll make sure you two

24:02.590 --> 24:03.370
won't be able

24:03.670 --> 24:05.330
to reach me today.

24:10.720 --> 24:11.980
Su Muyu.

24:12.430 --> 24:14.060
Why aren't you here yet?

24:29.800 --> 24:31.500
Miss, it seems you lied to us.

24:32.480 --> 24:33.370
Your poison array

24:33.870 --> 24:35.300
is starting to fade.

24:40.150 --> 24:41.060
Darned Su Muyu.

24:41.590 --> 24:42.500
He's always late to my rescue.

24:43.040 --> 24:44.170
I can't hang in there any longer.

24:45.800 --> 24:46.700
I'll give you guys the sword.

24:47.010 --> 24:47.920
You guys had better

24:47.920 --> 24:48.700
keep your promises.

24:49.720 --> 24:50.740
Don't kill me!

25:01.560 --> 25:02.460
What are you guys doing here?

25:03.280 --> 25:03.740
Chen the Dragon,

25:03.870 --> 25:04.540
take the sword with you.

25:04.800 --> 25:05.370
I'll cover the rear.

25:05.720 --> 25:06.090
All right.

25:27.240 --> 25:27.740
Chen the Dragon!

25:33.670 --> 25:34.330
Sir,

25:35.150 --> 25:36.090
I've helped you

25:36.760 --> 25:37.540
to retain

25:38.760 --> 25:40.130
the Dormant Dragon Sword.

25:43.480 --> 25:44.130
Chen the Dragon?

25:47.000 --> 25:48.460
He was struck by Mu Zizhe's Aqua Heartpiercer,

25:48.870 --> 25:49.570
Miss Bai.

25:51.960 --> 25:52.890
It has pierced through his heart.

25:53.830 --> 25:54.810
There's no way to rescue him.

26:07.630 --> 26:08.260
My dear girl.

26:08.960 --> 26:09.780
Are you okay?

26:21.560 --> 26:22.810
Brat with the umbrella,

26:23.910 --> 26:24.740
one of your buddies

26:24.760 --> 26:25.850
is already dead.

26:27.630 --> 26:28.780
You still have one left.

26:32.830 --> 26:33.940
Let's negotiate a deal.

26:35.040 --> 26:36.020
Give me the sword.

27:00.720 --> 27:01.940
Do you desire this sword?

27:03.480 --> 27:04.570
Give me the sword,

27:05.390 --> 27:06.980
and you may choose to pursue this sword later.

27:07.430 --> 27:09.370
But you have to wait for at least two hours.

27:10.760 --> 27:12.090
By then, the issue will be between you

27:12.110 --> 27:13.850
and Mu Zizhe.

27:18.590 --> 27:20.220
It will be none of my concern.

27:21.560 --> 27:22.170
Sir!

27:22.630 --> 27:23.570
Pay him no heed!

27:33.960 --> 27:34.610
Will you choose him?

27:35.910 --> 27:36.980
Or will you choose the sword?

27:44.670 --> 27:45.410
You only have one moment

27:45.430 --> 27:47.780
to consider it.

27:50.960 --> 27:51.650
Fine.

27:52.670 --> 27:53.460
I'll give you the sword.

28:02.520 --> 28:04.330
That was a powerful toss.

28:06.630 --> 28:08.410
Take this sword to the Mu family.

28:09.720 --> 28:10.460
Deliver it to him.

28:11.630 --> 28:12.740
After that, tell him this.

28:15.480 --> 28:16.700
I, Su Muyu, hereby swear

28:18.160 --> 28:20.260
that no matter what identity Mu Zizhe assumes,

28:21.240 --> 28:22.890
no matter where he goes,

28:24.190 --> 28:25.740
no matter how long it takes for me to reach him,

28:27.430 --> 28:28.460
I'll surely

28:31.110 --> 28:32.700
kill him with my own hands.

28:45.830 --> 28:46.650
Excellent.

28:51.190 --> 28:52.020
Excellent!

28:53.280 --> 28:54.020
Excellent!

28:56.320 --> 28:57.980
I'll surely deliver both the sword and your message.

29:10.040 --> 29:10.780
Yin the Tiger!

29:12.630 --> 29:13.220
Sir,

29:13.630 --> 29:14.650
we failed to protect the sword.

29:16.670 --> 29:17.540
It's good as long as you're okay.

29:17.720 --> 29:18.850
Darn it.

29:21.800 --> 29:22.500
Uncle Qidao.

29:24.080 --> 29:25.810
I thought you wouldn't get yourself involved.

29:26.800 --> 29:29.460
You should ask that darned buddy of yours.

29:47.040 --> 29:48.130
I've already obtained

29:49.040 --> 29:50.090
the sword you desired.

29:51.110 --> 29:52.260
Where's my antidote?

29:52.720 --> 29:54.610
I wasn't the one who took you to Jiuxiao City.

29:55.190 --> 29:57.090
He has the item you desire.

29:58.350 --> 29:59.090
You mean Water Official?

29:59.520 --> 30:01.130
He hasn't left Jiuxiao City yet.

30:02.080 --> 30:03.540
He won't leave

30:03.960 --> 30:05.370
before the end of the show.

30:08.520 --> 30:09.460
If so, Master Mu...

30:09.760 --> 30:10.410
No.

30:11.670 --> 30:12.650
I should address you

30:14.190 --> 30:15.330
as the Patriarch now.

30:18.000 --> 30:19.130
Patriarch,

30:20.560 --> 30:21.980
I shall take my leave now.

30:22.350 --> 30:23.220
But before that,

30:23.670 --> 30:25.090
someone requested me

30:25.350 --> 30:26.330
to deliver a message to you.

30:28.110 --> 30:28.780
Tell me.

30:30.190 --> 30:31.940
"I, Su Muyu, hereby swear

30:34.950 --> 30:37.220
that no matter what identity you assume,

30:37.870 --> 30:39.740
no matter where you go,

30:40.590 --> 30:41.540
no matter

30:43.150 --> 30:44.810
how long it takes for me to reach you,

30:45.800 --> 30:46.890
I'll surely

30:48.720 --> 30:50.260
kill you with my own hands."

30:57.240 --> 30:58.130
Su Muyu, huh?

30:58.910 --> 31:00.260
He's pretty arrogant, isn't he?

31:01.190 --> 31:01.810
But first,

31:02.280 --> 31:04.020
he at least has to survive for the day.

31:30.960 --> 31:31.740
The Mu family

31:32.350 --> 31:33.850
has already obtained the Dormant Dragon Sword.

31:34.800 --> 31:36.260
Congratulations, Master Mu.

31:36.520 --> 31:37.850
Congratulations, Master Mu.

31:38.150 --> 31:39.610
Congratulations, Patriarch.

31:39.830 --> 31:41.260
Congratulations, Patriarch.

31:41.800 --> 31:42.410
Excellent.

31:42.960 --> 31:43.780
Let's return

31:44.350 --> 31:45.780
to our sect immediately.

31:46.080 --> 31:46.610
Yes, sir.

31:53.240 --> 31:53.850
None of you

31:54.430 --> 31:56.300
will be able to leave this place alive.

31:58.590 --> 31:59.410
Xie Qidao,

32:00.190 --> 32:01.410
you actually came.

32:02.830 --> 32:03.980
It's as if you guys

32:04.190 --> 32:05.090
think that I shouldn't be here.

32:06.190 --> 32:08.020
But I'm here.

32:09.800 --> 32:11.610
I already have the Dormant Dragon Sword.

32:12.120 --> 32:14.170
I'm the current Patriarch of Blood River.

32:15.480 --> 32:16.220
What a joke.

32:17.320 --> 32:19.810
Even the fledglings of Blood River know

32:20.280 --> 32:21.890
that it's pointless to possess the Dormant Dragon Sword alone.

32:22.590 --> 32:24.460
You have to return to the sect in one piece.

32:25.080 --> 32:27.060
You're not the Patriarch until you receive the acknowledgment

32:27.280 --> 32:28.810
of the Soul Reapers' Hall's Three Officials.

32:29.350 --> 32:30.570
It's a shame

32:31.150 --> 32:32.650
that you won't be able to leave Jiuxiao City alive.

32:33.240 --> 32:34.020
I don't think

32:34.630 --> 32:36.130
you'll be able to leave this courtyard alive.

32:36.520 --> 32:37.650
You think you can stop me by yourself?

32:42.280 --> 32:42.940
Of course.

32:43.630 --> 32:44.610
I'm here as well.

32:49.520 --> 32:50.370
Xie Ba?

32:52.080 --> 32:53.300
Mu Zizhe,

32:54.080 --> 32:55.740
we've finally met

32:55.760 --> 32:56.500
at Jiuxiao City.

33:02.800 --> 33:03.410
Ba,

33:04.080 --> 33:04.980
sorry for the trouble.

33:05.520 --> 33:06.610
You were supposed

33:07.320 --> 33:08.850
to inherit my title.

33:09.670 --> 33:11.410
Once I retrieve the Dormant Dragon Sword

33:11.870 --> 33:13.090
and become the Patriarch,

33:13.800 --> 33:15.570
you shall be the next head

33:15.760 --> 33:17.130
of the Xie family.

33:28.670 --> 33:30.020
It seems I don't need to do anything.

33:30.560 --> 33:32.090
There's a good show about to happen.

33:33.350 --> 33:33.980
The Xie family is here

33:34.830 --> 33:36.330
with our 56 long sabers.

33:37.390 --> 33:38.940
We're here to retrieve one sword

33:39.670 --> 33:40.700
from the head of the Mu family.

33:41.000 --> 33:41.740
Retrieve one sword, huh?

33:42.280 --> 33:42.850
Do you know

33:42.870 --> 33:44.220
that Mu Bai died in an attempt

33:44.240 --> 33:45.300
to retrieve the Dormant Dragon Sword?

33:45.390 --> 33:46.130
I know that.

33:47.080 --> 33:47.890
But the Xie family

33:48.320 --> 33:49.810
didn't kill him.

33:50.520 --> 33:51.260
Moreover,

33:51.630 --> 33:53.700
my favorite disciple is also dead.

33:54.480 --> 33:55.810
You and I have been acquaintances for many years.

33:56.040 --> 33:57.330
Although we follow different paths,

33:58.240 --> 33:59.980
we're still friends for many years.

34:00.830 --> 34:01.780
There's no need for us

34:02.320 --> 34:04.130
to draw our swords against each other.

34:04.960 --> 34:05.810
What about this?

34:07.280 --> 34:08.690
Once I become the Patriarch,

34:09.590 --> 34:11.170
I'll appoint you as the Deputy Patriarch.

34:11.710 --> 34:13.210
After that, we can eradicate the Su family

34:13.440 --> 34:14.060
together.

34:14.520 --> 34:15.130
What do you think?

34:15.560 --> 34:16.290
What a joke.

34:17.000 --> 34:18.460
Do you think the Soul Reapers' Hall is just an empty hall?

34:19.040 --> 34:20.290
I'll become the Patriarch

34:20.920 --> 34:22.090
by hook or by crook.

34:23.010 --> 34:24.320
Darn it!

34:24.710 --> 34:26.380
What a fool.

34:26.920 --> 34:29.500
The Xie family and the Su family

34:30.190 --> 34:31.210
were always the vanguards

34:31.520 --> 34:33.020
of Blood River.

34:33.840 --> 34:35.090
The Mu family

34:35.440 --> 34:37.170
was just a bunch of cowards

34:37.310 --> 34:38.340
who attacked others from behind.

34:39.440 --> 34:40.570
What gives you the right

34:40.590 --> 34:41.980
to assume this position?

34:49.480 --> 34:50.860
I'll ask you this again.

34:51.840 --> 34:53.290
Have you decided to fight us?

34:53.880 --> 34:54.570
You don't say?

34:55.230 --> 34:55.770
Fine!

34:56.080 --> 34:56.650
My brothers!

34:57.110 --> 34:57.610
Yes, sir!

34:57.960 --> 34:59.020
Kill all members

34:59.560 --> 35:01.020
of the Mu family!

35:01.040 --> 35:01.650
Yes, sir!

35:05.560 --> 35:06.130
Set up the array!

35:06.480 --> 35:07.250
Array, Lone Void!

35:26.440 --> 35:28.090
I didn't expect you to show up.

35:30.150 --> 35:31.170
The Heaven Official grants blessings.

35:31.190 --> 35:32.380
The Earth Official pardons sins.

35:32.750 --> 35:34.170
The Water Official resolves misfortunes.

35:35.360 --> 35:36.980
Now, Blood River is in total chaos.

35:37.270 --> 35:39.340
Naturally, I have to resolve the current misfortune.

35:46.150 --> 35:47.500
The true Dormant Dragon Sword

35:47.520 --> 35:48.290
lies here with you,

35:48.840 --> 35:50.210
together with the dark secrets of Blood River.

35:50.560 --> 35:51.460
You've always held them

35:51.480 --> 35:52.980
tightly in your hands.

35:57.590 --> 35:59.420
Who assigned you to assassinate

36:00.310 --> 36:01.380
Second Master Tang?

36:02.880 --> 36:04.250
Naturally, it's someone you know.

36:05.150 --> 36:06.690
I assume everything that's been happening

36:07.400 --> 36:09.060
is also within his expectations, then.

36:10.840 --> 36:12.060
He's not a prophet.

36:12.150 --> 36:13.420
He can't foresee everything.

36:14.360 --> 36:15.650
However, he's also looking forward

36:15.880 --> 36:16.770
to the fact that the current Blood River

36:17.110 --> 36:17.730
will turn into

36:18.110 --> 36:18.900
an entirely new organization

36:18.920 --> 36:20.340
after this incident.

36:22.110 --> 36:23.690
But no matter what Blood River will turn into,

36:24.110 --> 36:25.540
I should never be here.

36:27.710 --> 36:29.340
You do live up to your reputation as the Patriarch.

36:35.960 --> 36:37.340
I can head to Homeland.

36:38.790 --> 36:39.820
Homeland?

36:43.310 --> 36:44.500
Do you mean the legendary sanctuary

36:44.520 --> 36:45.770
of Blood River?

36:48.400 --> 36:50.250
The sanctuary that can allow people

36:51.480 --> 36:52.940
to put down their feuds and grudges

36:54.000 --> 36:55.020
and lead a peaceful life?

36:59.670 --> 37:01.020
I wouldn't have thought of it as hilarious

37:01.040 --> 37:02.500
if someone else were to utter the same thing.

37:03.000 --> 37:04.290
But you're the Patriarch.

37:05.080 --> 37:05.940
You should know

37:06.590 --> 37:07.340
that

37:07.710 --> 37:09.460
Homeland never existed.

37:09.790 --> 37:11.130
That was just a lie.

37:13.230 --> 37:15.020
I was the Patriarch for 30 years.

37:17.190 --> 37:19.130
My reign lasted longer than any of those before me.

37:19.790 --> 37:21.290
Therefore, I've achieved something

37:21.750 --> 37:23.770
that they couldn't manage to achieve.

37:25.440 --> 37:27.250
So, you actually built such a place

37:29.110 --> 37:30.170
secretly

37:30.190 --> 37:31.210
behind our backs, huh?

37:34.480 --> 37:36.610
Is that the escape route

37:36.920 --> 37:37.690
that you've built for yourself?

37:40.400 --> 37:41.830
Are you going to defy the Three Officials?

37:45.920 --> 37:46.760
Something's off.

37:47.960 --> 37:49.080
That palm strike of yours...

37:50.310 --> 37:51.540
The Snow Falls on a Plum Blossom poison in your body

37:51.710 --> 37:52.820
is actually neutralized.

37:53.920 --> 37:55.770
I've been the Patriarch for 30 years.

37:56.400 --> 37:57.060
The only thing

37:57.080 --> 37:58.250
that I haven't managed to achieve

37:58.840 --> 37:59.770
is to admit defeat.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.460
You guys intend to use my death

38:05.190 --> 38:07.210
to create a new version of Blood River.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.650
However, to me,

38:10.190 --> 38:11.250
Blood River will only be able to

38:12.000 --> 38:13.690
embrace a new future

38:13.880 --> 38:15.090
after your deaths.

38:17.400 --> 38:18.500
Just like what you said,

38:19.400 --> 38:21.540
the poison in my body has been neutralized.

38:22.360 --> 38:22.940
You are no match

38:23.790 --> 38:25.060
for me.

38:27.560 --> 38:29.060
I think you should understand

38:30.000 --> 38:31.650
that Blood River never belonged to you.

38:32.590 --> 38:33.460
The Soul Reapers' Hall

38:33.560 --> 38:35.060
doesn't own Blood River either.

38:35.920 --> 38:36.730
It's just

38:36.750 --> 38:38.250
a tool meant for killing.

38:39.310 --> 38:40.980
We don't have the right to decide how it's used.

38:41.710 --> 38:43.540
Only those who command it have the right.

38:44.840 --> 38:46.020
That's the one thing I wanted to change

38:47.230 --> 38:49.290
during my 30 years of reign.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.730
Although I couldn't achieve that,

38:52.670 --> 38:53.690
I'm sure someone can achieve that

38:54.480 --> 38:56.460
in the end.

38:57.270 --> 38:58.130
If so,

38:59.560 --> 39:00.460
I shall wait for your good news.

39:09.310 --> 39:09.940
Sir.

39:11.440 --> 39:12.290
The Dormant Dragon Sword?

39:17.340 --> 39:20.820
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

39:20.860 --> 39:24.740
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

39:26.580 --> 39:30.060
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

39:30.100 --> 39:33.940
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

39:35.940 --> 39:39.220
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

39:39.340 --> 39:41.420
♪Still I can't let go♪

39:41.580 --> 39:45.020
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

39:45.500 --> 39:47.700
♪My heart no longer my own♪

39:47.820 --> 39:52.820
♪No one can escape from love♪

40:09.420 --> 40:13.140
♪How many hidden feelings♪

40:13.260 --> 40:17.340
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

40:18.580 --> 40:22.460
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

40:22.580 --> 40:26.820
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

40:27.940 --> 40:30.820
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

40:30.900 --> 40:35.140
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

40:37.420 --> 40:41.420
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

40:41.460 --> 40:44.900
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

